---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const channelUrl = "https://pd.qq.com/s/g39qgegw0?b=9";
---

<BaseLayout title="投稿 · SCU LENS" active="/submit">
  <div class="page-shell">
    <section class="page-hero submit-hero">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Contribute · 投稿</div>
        <h1 class="display">投稿</h1>
      </div>
      <p>日常作品与「每月九图」专项征集都从这里进入。加入四川大学摄影协会 QQ 频道，选择对应板块发布你的作品。</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section submit-main">
      <div class="submit-copy">
        <div class="eyebrow">How to Submit</div>
        <h2>在频道里发布你的作品。</h2>
        <p>进入四川大学摄影协会 QQ 频道后，根据作品类型选择对应板块投稿。照片可以来自相机、胶片或手机，日常投稿张数不限。</p>

        <div class="submit-rules">
          <article>
            <span>01</span>
            <h3>注明署名</h3>
            <p>发布时请注明用于展示的署名，可以使用真实姓名，也可以使用网名。</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <span>02</span>
            <h3>选择分区</h3>
            <p>根据作品类型进入相机组、胶片组或手机组对应板块，不需要在官网重复上传。</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <span>03</span>
            <h3>补充文字</h3>
            <p>可以附上照片的描述、拍摄心得或理解，帮助我们更完整地理解作品。</p>
          </article>
        </div>

        <a class="submit-primary" href={channelUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">打开 QQ 频道投稿 ↗</a>
      </div>

      <a class="submit-qr" href={channelUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
        <div class="submit-qr-head">
          <img src="/images/brand/scu-lens-logo-simple.png" alt="" />
          <div>
            <strong>四川大学摄影协会</strong>
            <span>频道号 · pd77222624</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <img class="submit-qr-image" src="/images/qq-channel-qr.png" alt="四川大学摄影协会 QQ 频道二维码" />
        <div class="submit-qr-foot">
          <span>扫码加入频道</span>
          <b>QQ CHANNEL</b>
        </div>
      </a>
    </section>

    <section class="section submit-note">
      <div class="eyebrow">Rights & Notes</div>
      <p>投稿作品应为本人原创，并确保拥有相应发布权。作品若被选入官网、每月九图或其他协会展示，将按投稿署名进行标注。</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .submit-hero { padding-bottom:48px; }
  .submit-hero p { max-width:560px; font-size:.98rem; line-height:1.8; }
  .submit-main { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.15fr) minmax(300px,.85fr); gap:clamp(36px,6vw,90px); align-items:start; }
  .submit-copy h2 { margin:12px 0 18px; font:400 clamp(2.4rem,5vw,5rem)/.95 Georgia,serif; letter-spacing:-.055em; }
  .submit-copy > p,.submit-note p { color:var(--muted); line-height:1.8; }
  .submit-rules { margin:36px 0; border-top:1px solid var(--line); }
  .submit-rules article { display:grid; grid-template-columns:42px 150px minmax(0,1fr); gap:18px; padding:22px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); align-items:start; }
  .submit-rules span { color:var(--muted); font-size:.7rem; letter-spacing:.1em; }
  .submit-rules h3 { margin:0; font:400 1.2rem/1.2 Georgia,serif; }
  .submit-rules p { margin:0; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.7; font-size:.9rem; }
  .submit-primary { display:inline-block; padding:12px 0 7px; border-bottom:1px solid currentColor; font-weight:800; }
  .submit-qr { display:block; padding:24px; border:1px solid var(--line); background:rgba(255,255,255,.42); color:inherit; }
  .submit-qr-head { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px; }
  .submit-qr-head > img { width:48px; height:48px; object-fit:cover; }
  .submit-qr-head div { display:grid; gap:4px; }
  .submit-qr-head span { color:var(--muted); font-size:.72rem; }
  .submit-qr-image { display:block; width:min(100%,360px); margin:28px auto; background:white; }
  .submit-qr-foot { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:20px; padding-top:16px; border-top:1px solid var(--line); font-size:.72rem; }
  .submit-note { display:grid; grid-template-columns:180px minmax(0,1fr); gap:32px; }
  .submit-note p { margin:0; max-width:760px; }
  @media (max-width:700px) {
    .submit-main,.submit-note { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .submit-rules article { grid-template-columns:32px 1fr; gap:10px 14px; }
    .submit-rules article p { grid-column:2; }
    .submit-qr { padding:18px; }
  }
</style>
